      "source": [
        "# EV spare-parts import prioritisation: scoring, rankings and sensitivity\n",
        "\n",
        "Vehicles: BYD Seagull, BYD Yuan Up, VW ID.4. Ten part categories, 30 vehicle-category rows.\n",
        "\n",
        "* Runs top to bottom from a `data/` folder. No network calls and no API keys.\n",
        "* The factor values come from `data/scoring_input.csv` (built by `make_scoring_input.py` from the cleaned evidence). The written rules are in `data/scoring_rules.csv` (v4: Ethiopian \"not found\" = neutral 0.5).\n",
        "* Two rankings: **vehicle-part** (30 rows) and **part-category** (10 rows; the three vehicles combined, weighted by marketplace **listing counts**).\n",
        "* **Listing counts are listing counts**, not sales, registrations or demand. \"Not found\" means *not found on the sources inspected*, not scarcity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 8,
      "id": "be3fe8d3",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-16T20:13:08.844669Z",
